 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- The terminal pane can now split to run a local login shell alongside the
+  agent attach — ⌘D splits vertically, ⇧⌘D horizontally, and the divider
+  drags with a persisted ratio. ⌘W closes the split first and only closes the
+  window once it's gone. First phase of a series; keyboard focus/resize
+  controls and a remote shell over SSH follow in later issues.
+
